        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Global energy demand and costs continue to increase. Both contribute directly to our electricity consumption and renewable energy purchase strategy. Energy from renewable sources helps us transition away from carbon-intensive sources and reduce our emissions. We used renewable energy in the form of on-site solar generation, green power sources and unbundled and bundled renewable energy certificates (RECs) for our U.S. locations. As members of the RE100 initiative, we adhere to the group's technical guidance on renewable energy procurement. In FY24, we sourced 61.5% of electricity from renewable sources across all Dell facilities.",
